#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:3
msgid "Part types"
msgstr "零件类型"

#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:5
msgid ""
"A **part type plugin** teaches PartCAD how to build a part. The types "
"PartCAD implements itself -- ``build123d``, ``cadquery``, ``openscad``, "
"``step``, ``stl``, and the rest of :ref:`the list <part-types>` -- are what "
"a part's ``type:`` normally names. A ``partTypes:`` section declares one "
"more, belonging to the package that writes it, and parts then name that "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"**零件类型插件** 教 PartCAD 怎么构建一个零件。PartCAD 自己实现的那些类型 -- ``build123d`` 、 "
"``cadquery`` 、 ``openscad`` 、 ``step`` 、 ``stl`` ，以及 :ref:`那份清单 <part-"
"types>` 中的其余各项 -- 就是零件的 ``type:`` 通常所指名的东西。而一个 ``partTypes:`` "
"小节会再声明一种，它属于写下它的那个包，于是各个零件就改为指名那一种。"

#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:11
msgid ""
"It is worth doing when **a family of parts is produced the same way every "
"time** and the difference between them is a handful of parameters rather "
"than a script each: parts generated from a table, fetched from a catalogue, "
"or built by a modelling helper the package already has. Twenty bolts become "
"twenty parameter sets and one script, not twenty scripts."
msgstr ""
"当 "
"**一族零件每次都以同样的方式产出**、而它们之间的差别只是少数几个参数而不是各自一个脚本时，这件事就值得做：从一张表格生成出来的零件、从某个目录册取来的零件，或者由该包本来就有的某个建模辅助工具构建出来的零件。二十个螺栓于是变成二十组参数加一个脚本，而不是二十个脚本。"

#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:18
msgid "What a part type is for"
msgstr "零件类型的用途"

#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:20
msgid ""
"**A parametric family.** One script, a ``parameters:`` block per part. The "
"script is the only place the geometry is written down, so a fix to it fixes "
"every part of the family at once."
msgstr ""
"**一个参数化族。** 一个脚本，每个零件一个 ``parameters:`` "
"块。脚本是几何被写下来的唯一地方，所以对它的一次修正就一次性修正了这一族的每一个零件。"

#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:23
msgid ""
"**A catalogue.** A type that reads a vendor's table or API and returns the "
"shape for a given part number, so the package's parts are the part numbers."
msgstr "**一份目录册。** 一种会读取某个厂商的表格或 API、并针对给定零件号返回其形状的类型，于是该包的各个零件就是那些零件号。"

#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:25
msgid ""
"**A house modelling convention** -- a profile system, a sheet-metal "
"enclosure, a connector family -- published once as a package other packages "
"import."
msgstr "**一套内部建模约定** -- 一个型材系统、一种钣金外壳、一族连接器 -- 发布一次，作为一个包供其他包导入。"

#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:28
msgid ""
"**A kernel or a helper PartCAD does not know about.** The script runs in its"
" own sandbox and can import whatever it needs."
msgstr "**一个 PartCAD 不认识的内核或辅助工具。** 脚本运行在它自己的沙箱中，可以导入它所需要的任何东西。"

#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:32
msgid "Using one"
msgstr "使用一种零件类型"

#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:34
msgid ""
"A ``type:`` beginning with ``:`` names a part type of the part's own package"
" and is expanded to ``<package path>:<name>`` when the package loads. Write "
"the package path out to use another package's:"
msgstr ""
"以 ``:`` 开头的 ``type:`` 指名的是该零件自己所在包里的一种零件类型，在包加载时会被展开成 ``<package "
"path>:<name>`` 。要使用另一个包的零件类型，就把包路径完整写出来："

#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:52
msgid ""
"A part built this way is an ordinary part in every other respect: it "
"renders, exports, tests, goes into assemblies and into a bill of materials. "
"A part type is listed like any other object but **is never a shape in its "
"own right** -- it is how parts are made, not one of them."
msgstr ""
"以这种方式构建出来的零件，在其他每一方面都是普通的零件：它能渲染、能导出、能测试、能进装配体、能进物料清单。零件类型会像其他任何对象一样被列出，但 "
"**它本身绝不是一个形状** -- 它是零件被制造出来的方式，而不是其中的一个。"

#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:58
msgid "Writing one"
msgstr "编写一种零件类型"

#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:77
msgid ""
"The script is run in the sandbox once per part, with the part's ``request`` "
"in its globals -- the resolved ``parameters`` among them -- and leaves the "
"geometry in a global ``output``:"
msgstr ""
"脚本在沙箱中按每个零件运行一次，该零件的 ``request`` 放在它的全局变量里 -- 其中包括已解析好的 ``parameters`` -- "
"而它把几何留在一个全局的 ``output`` 中："

#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:89
msgid ""
"Because the script runs in a sandbox it may import OCP, build123d or "
"CadQuery. This is the same mechanism as an :doc:`output implementation "
"</plugins/output>`, pointed at building a shape rather than at writing a "
"file."
msgstr ""
"由于脚本运行在沙箱中，它可以导入 OCP、build123d 或 CadQuery。这与 :doc:`输出实现 </plugins/output>` "
"是同一套机制，只是指向构建一个形状，而不是指向写出一个文件。"

#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:93
msgid "Two things to get right:"
msgstr "有两件事要做对："

#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:95
msgid "``CACHE_VERSION``"
msgstr "``CACHE_VERSION``"

#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:96
msgid ""
"A part built by a part type is cached like any other, keyed on the version "
"the script reports as well as on the part's own configuration -- a module-"
"level ``CACHE_VERSION = <int>``, read **without running the script**. Raise "
"it whenever a change to the script changes the parts it builds; an edit that"
" does not -- a comment, a refactoring -- then costs nobody a rebuild. "
"Forgetting to raise it is the one failure mode here, and it shows up as a "
"stale shape."
msgstr ""
"由零件类型构建出来的零件会像其他零件一样被缓存，而它的缓存键既取决于零件自身的配置，也取决于脚本所报告的版本 -- 也就是一个模块级的 "
"``CACHE_VERSION = <int>`` ，它是在 **不运行脚本** "
"的情况下被读取的。只要对脚本的改动会改变它构建出来的零件，就把它提高；而不会改变零件的修改 -- 一条注释、一次重构 -- "
"就不会让任何人付出重新构建的代价。忘了提高它是这里唯一的失效方式，而它表现出来就是一个过期的形状。"

#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:103
msgid "``pythonRequirements`` belongs to the plugin"
msgstr "``pythonRequirements`` 属于插件"

#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:104
msgid ""
"It is read from the package that ships the script and from nowhere else, so "
"a part type's dependencies never reach the package using it."
msgstr "它只从附带该脚本的那个包读取，别处一概不读，所以零件类型的依赖绝不会波及到使用它的那个包。"

