msgstr ""
"``examples/produce_part_wrapper`` 用两个文件讲完了整件事。该包声明了一种零件类型，以及一个用它构建出来的零件："

#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:129
msgid "``box_wrapper.py`` is the script above. From that directory:"
msgstr "``box_wrapper.py`` 就是上面那个脚本。在该目录下："

#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:139
msgid "The part built by the box partType, shown in the Digital Thread"
msgstr "由 box partType 构建出来的那个零件，显示在 Digital Thread 中"

#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:144
msgid ""
"``box`` is absent from ``pc list parts``, because it is a ``partType`` and "
"not a part -- PartCAD counts the two as different kinds of object "
"(``partType`` is one of the ten in ``Project.OBJECT_KINDS``), and only one "
"of them is a shape."
msgstr ""
"``box`` 不会出现在 ``pc list parts`` 里，因为它是一个 ``partType`` 而不是一个零件 -- PartCAD "
"把这两者算作不同种类的对象（ ``partType`` 是 ``Project.OBJECT_KINDS`` 中那十种之一），而其中只有一种是形状。"
